open":false},"evidence":{"source":"frozen-model","summary":{"business_id":"Hh-LHf0bUYoyOnm3DITuXw","user_id":"D76EFdD5F7XoIIyQmWTQhA","user_row":3279,"nv_rank":729,"mm_rank":607,"target_category_support_fraction":0.42857142857142855,"selected_image_count":2,"label_diversity":2,"target_visual_score_gain":null,"target_visual_rank_gain":null,"competitive_visual_rank_effect":null},"category_overlap":[{"category":"Hotels","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Event Planning & Services","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Nightlife","historical_business_count":5},{"category":"Bars","historical_business_count":5},{"category":"Hotels & Travel","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Dive Bars","historical_business_count":0},{"category":"Pubs","historical_business_count":2}],"history":[{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Pubs","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Pubs","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Hh-LHf0bUYoyOnm3DITuXw","review_id":"VuMguTqIxw2uXJCp51XOsQ","date":"2009-12-05T22:17:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9394956827163696,"text_excerpt":"Flanagan's is close to Hotel Provincial and I ended up here two nights over a time span of four nights because the drinks are really that good. The bartenders are friendly and the atmosphere is unpretentious and not too crazy like Bourbon. Yes it is a dive bar, but more in the Cheers punk side. The rum and cokes are killer and the customers are worth talking to. We had a take out lunch here and they were very quick and the food was good. This bar is definitely a staple for me."},{"business_id":"Hh-LHf0bUYoyOnm3DITuXw","review_id":"1mhwVoYhd7Jl3Qy009uAEw","date":"2013-05-06T12:09:20","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9343387484550476,"text_excerpt":"Flanagan's became our \"Cheers\" during our all-too-short visit to New Orleans. For being in the Quarter, it's remarkably non-touristy with great bartenders and fantastic prices. I asked for a bourbon by name and gave the bartender a tenner expecting no change back. I got plenty. Pair that with a great Irish/punk soundtrack and the fact that they were open 24 hours, and Flanagan's was a winner. It's also the starting point for a New Orleans ghost tour--tickets can be purchased at the bar."},{"business_id":"Hh-LHf0bUYoyOnm3DITuXw","review_id":"pTQB993FOXgqMM6buTz1LQ","date":"2011-04-25T20:34:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.933983325958252,"text_excerpt":"When I'm in the quarter, I always like to stop in at Flanagan's. It's one of those bars that's off the \"beaten path\" and a nice escape from the hustle and bustle of Bourbon (if you're a tourist) or even Decatur (if you aren't). The bar is open 24 hours and the bartenders here are really nice and friendly. This is more of a bar to go to, if you are a liquor drinker, as their beer on tap is pretty limited, but the atmosphere definitely makes up for the lack of beer (and one beer that they DO have on tap is Harp, and you can never go wrong with that). It's definitely a great place to check out, if you have something to celebrate, as they have a lot of room. The room in the back is my favorit..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Hh-LHf0bUYoyOnm3DITuXw","photo_id":"L8WGcFAzk17dis3tFPvf8A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/L8WGcFAzk17dis3tFPvf8A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9241452217102051},{"business_id":"Hh-LHf0bUYoyOnm3DITuXw","photo_id":"JnZBonHHLl1isDc9dBbiWA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/JnZBonHHLl1isDc9dBbiWA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9241451025009155}]},"notebook_case":null}
